## Quality Outlook

- quality_outlook: Prove the same target, Run, attempt and turn for the winning eligible start. Cover wrong profile, ordinary Run, stale identity, both conflict cases, reopen and predecessor behavior. Keep the test evidence attributable to the exact installed candidate and distinct from a qualification decision.
